  <processInformation>
    <dataSetInformation>
      <common:UUID>0e809c97-80e6-4768-9fd9-37e4a7e867fb</common:UUID>
      <name>
        <baseName xml:lang="en">Mustard, Production and disposal of 1 kg of mustard, packaging included</baseName>
        <treatmentStandardsRoutes> Production and disposal of 1 kg of mustard</treatmentStandardsRoutes>
        <mixAndLocationTypes> Packaging included</mixAndLocationTypes>
      </name>
      <common:synonyms>Mostarda</common:synonyms>
      <classificationInformation>
        <common:classification name="ILCDCategories" classes="../ILCDClassification.xml">
          <common:class level="0">Materials production</common:class>
          <common:class level="1">Food and renewable raw materials</common:class>
        </common:classification>
      </classificationInformation>
      <common:generalComment>The dataset has been developed in LIFE EFFIGE project. Details are given in “PEFCR of Mustard”. In a cradle to grave approach, the dataset includes the all input and output for the production of 1 kg of nougat at the consumer, including its packaging and the end of life of the packaging materials.</common:generalComment>
    </dataSetInformation>
    <quantitativeReference type="Reference flow(s)">
      <referenceToReferenceFlow>0</referenceToReferenceFlow>
    </quantitativeReference>
    <time>
      <common:referenceYear>2018</common:referenceYear>
      <common:dataSetValidUntil>2024</common:dataSetValidUntil>
    </time>
    <geography>
      <locationOfOperationSupplyOrProduction location="IT"/>
    </geography>
    <technology>
      <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>The dataset includes the model of the production 1 kg of mustard at the consumer, including the end of life of its packaging materials. &#13;
The following life cycle phases are included :&#13;
Inputs production – agricultural stage&#13;
Production – cooking stage (candied fruit)&#13;
Production – mustard addition and packaging stage&#13;
Distribution Chain &#13;
Use &#13;
End of Life</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
      <technologicalApplicability>Due to several assumptions and estimation included in the model, the dataset can be used for those cases where the impact of storage operations is not the main contribution to the total impact of the system. </technologicalApplicability>
    </technology>
  </processInformation>
